{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in multiprofile settings compared to scvi_n200, with avgpool aggregation. The validation accuracy of 0.5305 and F1 score of 0.5152 are lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501 and 0.6275), suggesting scgpt may not improve performance in this configuration. However, the limited comparative evidence leaves uncertainty about whether this result generalizes to other datasets or aggregation methods."
}

